[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l007","ordinal":125441,"en":"Forty guards, all your pent-up anguish has eased;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l009","ordinal":125442,"en":"Forty guards, your grief has now subsided."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l010","ordinal":125443,"en":"Your stag has run from the hills."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l011","ordinal":125444,"en":"Do not mourn, forty guards:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l012","ordinal":125445,"en":"Your generous one has come alive today."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l013","ordinal":125446,"en":"Your missing part has come today."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l014","ordinal":125447,"en":"Do not grieve, forty guards:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l015","ordinal":125448,"en":"God has given you abundance."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l016","ordinal":125449,"en":"Sorrow has vanished from your hearts."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l017","ordinal":125450,"en":"Your orphan has come, forty guards;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l018","ordinal":125451,"en":"All your affairs have been set right!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l019","ordinal":125452,"en":"When he heard this from Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l020","ordinal":125453,"en":"His thoughts broke loose."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l021","ordinal":125454,"en":"He fell upon and clasped him—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l022","ordinal":125455,"en":"Bölökbai clasped the boy left by Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l023","ordinal":125456,"en":"While Bölökbai stood weeping,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l024","ordinal":125457,"en":"Mighty Khan Bakai wept."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l025","ordinal":125458,"en":"The sight was hard to bear;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l026","ordinal":125459,"en":"All forty guards were weeping."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l027","ordinal":125460,"en":"Since the treasury was scattered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l028","ordinal":125461,"en":"Since they vanished and fled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l029","ordinal":125462,"en":"The torment of this world—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l030","ordinal":125463,"en":"Since they suffered it without respite,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l031","ordinal":125464,"en":"Twelve years had passed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l032","ordinal":125465,"en":"At the time they reached the boy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l033","ordinal":125466,"en":"The forty guards and Bölökbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l034","ordinal":125467,"en":"As they stood weeping—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l035","ordinal":125468,"en":"If the boy had not come that year,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l036","ordinal":125469,"en":"The guards were at the point of (being) wiped out."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l038","ordinal":125470,"en":"The forty guards and Bölökbai—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b003:l039","ordinal":125471,"en":"When the boy stood and looked at them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l001","ordinal":125472,"en":"Not one whole garment clothed them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l002","ordinal":125473,"en":"“Faithful friends left by my father Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l003","ordinal":125474,"en":"If God brings it upon a mortal,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l004","ordinal":125475,"en":"Anything can come to pass."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l005","ordinal":125476,"en":"May my fierce father never die;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l006","ordinal":125477,"en":"The humiliation left after that fierce one—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l007","ordinal":125478,"en":"May God not give it to his servants."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l008","ordinal":125479,"en":"Bölökbai, left by my father Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l009","ordinal":125480,"en":"Was the khan of the treasury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l010","ordinal":125481,"en":"A man endowed with sacred power."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l011","ordinal":125482,"en":"While my fierce father lived,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l012","ordinal":125483,"en":"He skillfully fashioned every precious thing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l013","ordinal":125484,"en":"Making each object peerless:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l014","ordinal":125485,"en":"Swords, guns, and valuables,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l015","ordinal":125486,"en":"He made them wonderfully."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l016","ordinal":125487,"en":"For my lion father, above all,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l017","ordinal":125488,"en":"He supplied what was lacking,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l018","ordinal":125489,"en":"Brought into being what was absent."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l019","ordinal":125490,"en":"The black gun and Arkesken"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l020","ordinal":125491,"en":"He fashioned as they ought to be."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l021","ordinal":125492,"en":"Clouds stirred in the sky;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l022","ordinal":125493,"en":"Döötü and Bölökbai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l023","ordinal":125494,"en":"Were friends for the next world."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l024","ordinal":125495,"en":"At the bellows, he contended;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l025","ordinal":125496,"en":"When your Bölökö struck with his hammer,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l026","ordinal":125497,"en":"He consulted with Döötü."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l027","ordinal":125498,"en":"Parted from his companion—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l028","ordinal":125499,"en":"To tell this world's tale briefly—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l029","ordinal":125500,"en":"His fame reached all the world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l030","ordinal":125501,"en":"That dear smith Bölökbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l031","ordinal":125502,"en":"Of my leopard father, Khan Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l032","ordinal":125503,"en":"The smith of Manas Khan."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l033","ordinal":125504,"en":"My father's countless gold coins,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l034","ordinal":125505,"en":"My six elder kinsmen came and scattered."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l035","ordinal":125506,"en":"Suffering harsh humiliation there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l036","ordinal":125507,"en":"On that day, oh God,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l037","ordinal":125508,"en":"My Bölökö had arrived."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l038","ordinal":125509,"en":"Bölökbai's forty young men"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0634:b004:l039","ordinal":125510,"en":"Had been given the name ‘forty guards,’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l001","ordinal":125511,"en":"Bringing them into disgrace,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l002","ordinal":125512,"en":"When leopard Manas died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l003","ordinal":125513,"en":"Their kindled fire was quenched,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l004","ordinal":125514,"en":"They were all driven from their homes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l005","ordinal":125515,"en":"Screaming under humiliation,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l006","ordinal":125516,"en":"Crying, ‘Alas, Manas, do not die!’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l007","ordinal":125517,"en":"They went away in tears."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l008","ordinal":125518,"en":"Vanishing from sight, they lived;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l009","ordinal":125519,"en":"Fleeing, they kept themselves alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l010","ordinal":125520,"en":"They cried from the mountaintops,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l011","ordinal":125521,"en":"‘Will Semetey ever come?’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l012","ordinal":125522,"en":"Calling to everyone they saw."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l013","ordinal":125523,"en":"Twelve years had passed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l014","ordinal":125524,"en":"They had suffered such misery"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l015","ordinal":125525,"en":"That they were at the point of death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l016","ordinal":125526,"en":"The reason they were dying—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l017","ordinal":125527,"en":"When they came there wailing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l018","ordinal":125528,"en":"Manas's son saw the extent of it:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l019","ordinal":125529,"en":"Barefoot and bareheaded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l020","ordinal":125530,"en":"Their wretched heads grown piebald,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l021","ordinal":125531,"en":"Their torn coats split apart,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l022","ordinal":125532,"en":"With Khan Bölökbai at their head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l023","ordinal":125533,"en":"Bowl-sized patches of flesh exposed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l024","ordinal":125534,"en":"From all his suffering, my Bölökö"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l025","ordinal":125535,"en":"Was at the point of death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l026","ordinal":125536,"en":"Terrible hardship, calamity—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l027","ordinal":125537,"en":"Had the boy not come then,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l028","ordinal":125538,"en":"That was what awaited them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l029","ordinal":125539,"en":"His trousers of yellow hide"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l030","ordinal":125540,"en":"Had split into countless pieces."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l031","ordinal":125541,"en":"He scarcely looked human;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l032","ordinal":125542,"en":"Oh, dear Bölökbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l033","ordinal":125543,"en":"He looked like a scarecrow."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l034","ordinal":125544,"en":"When dear Manas was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l035","ordinal":125545,"en":"Bölökbai was a giant of a smith,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l036","ordinal":125546,"en":"Master of the treasury."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l037","ordinal":125547,"en":"In blue-gray lynx and marten caps,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l038","ordinal":125548,"en":"He was a khan who tossed his head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b003:l039","ordinal":125549,"en":"Possessing great wealth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l001","ordinal":125550,"en":"He had lived in delight."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l002","ordinal":125551,"en":"The multitude of Kyrgyz made for the lowlands;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l003","ordinal":125552,"en":"Those were the days when they camped there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l004","ordinal":125553,"en":"By day, kumis; by night, girls—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l005","ordinal":125554,"en":"Such had been his life."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l006","ordinal":125555,"en":"When the leopard was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l007","ordinal":125556,"en":"This Bölökbai standing here"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l008","ordinal":125557,"en":"Would take a whole beaver skin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l009","ordinal":125558,"en":"Split it in two,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l010","ordinal":125559,"en":"And put it on his trouser cuffs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l011","ordinal":125560,"en":"Bölökbai, master of the treasury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l012","ordinal":125561,"en":"Shot roe deer when he was bored."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l013","ordinal":125562,"en":"Racing two-year colts, flying hawks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l014","ordinal":125563,"en":"When his companion Manas lived,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l015","ordinal":125564,"en":"He reveled wildly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l016","ordinal":125565,"en":"When that Manas died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l017","ordinal":125566,"en":"Your Khan Bölö fled and wandered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l018","ordinal":125567,"en":"A wretched coat across his shoulders—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l019","ordinal":125568,"en":"He ran with perfect speed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l020","ordinal":125569,"en":"Life is sweet; one will not enter the earth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l021","ordinal":125570,"en":"Thus he had suffered humiliation."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l022","ordinal":125571,"en":"Seen today, gone tomorrow—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l023","ordinal":125572,"en":"The misery Bölökbai had suffered!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l024","ordinal":125573,"en":"Damn it, the world is shit!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l025","ordinal":125574,"en":"Mountain-like Manas had died."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l026","ordinal":125575,"en":"Living along the mountain slopes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l027","ordinal":125576,"en":"Bölökbai had kept himself alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l028","ordinal":125577,"en":"Barefoot and bareheaded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l029","ordinal":125578,"en":"Bölökbai had wandered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l030","ordinal":125579,"en":"Saying, “My cherished orphan will return,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l031","ordinal":125580,"en":"For Khan Manas's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l032","ordinal":125581,"en":"Bölökbai's heart had burned."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l033","ordinal":125582,"en":"Once Bölökbai saw the boy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l034","ordinal":125583,"en":"A honeysuckle staff in his hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l035","ordinal":125584,"en":"A wretched coat upon his back,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l036","ordinal":125585,"en":"He hurried toward the boy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l037","ordinal":125586,"en":"To the orphan, Manas's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l038","ordinal":125587,"en":"He came with pleas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0635:b005:l039","ordinal":125588,"en":"While Bölökbai stood weeping,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l001","ordinal":125589,"en":"Semetey was in his arms."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l002","ordinal":125590,"en":"All forty guards were weeping."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l003","ordinal":125591,"en":"Daughter-damning, treacherous world!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l004","ordinal":125592,"en":"Your precious Bakai wept as well;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l005","ordinal":125593,"en":"The heroes wept, the khan wept,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l006","ordinal":125594,"en":"The dear orphan boy was weeping."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l007","ordinal":125595,"en":"Bölökbai wept and cried aloud."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l008","ordinal":125596,"en":"The warrior left by Manas had grown old;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l009","ordinal":125597,"en":"He stood there wailing, sobbing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l010","ordinal":125598,"en":"“To the city of Khan Temir,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l011","ordinal":125599,"en":"You wandered and grew up there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l012","ordinal":125600,"en":"My ocean, orphan, are you well?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l013","ordinal":125601,"en":"Among the multitude of Sarts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l014","ordinal":125602,"en":"You fled and grew up there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l015","ordinal":125603,"en":"Alas, my only one, are you well?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l016","ordinal":125604,"en":"My delight left by Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l017","ordinal":125605,"en":"My mirror left by the warrior!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l018","ordinal":125606,"en":"I wandered long in the mountains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l019","ordinal":125607,"en":"Wondering whether my only young falcon"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l020","ordinal":125608,"en":"Would ever come."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l021","ordinal":125609,"en":"I gathered what the learned men passed down;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l022","ordinal":125610,"en":"For twelve years I saw no people;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l023","ordinal":125611,"en":"So my wretched life withered away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l024","ordinal":125612,"en":"Oh, my hoof left by the winged steed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l025","ordinal":125613,"en":"Oh, my unbroken courser, my dear one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l026","ordinal":125614,"en":"Oh, my banner fixed upon a spear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l027","ordinal":125615,"en":"Oh, my gift left by the generous one!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l028","ordinal":125616,"en":"Oh, I suffered humiliation and anguish;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l029","ordinal":125617,"en":"My orphan, I prayed for you to God alone!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l031","ordinal":125618,"en":"I wandered long, lamenting, wailing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l032","ordinal":125619,"en":"Wondering whether Semetey, left by my Khan Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l033","ordinal":125620,"en":"Would ever come."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l034","ordinal":125621,"en":"I wailed and wandered long in sorrow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l035","ordinal":125622,"en":"Wondering when my one-born falcon"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l036","ordinal":125623,"en":"Would ever come."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l037","ordinal":125624,"en":"Has God granted my wish?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l038","ordinal":125625,"en":"Has my support, my orphan, come?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b003:l039","ordinal":125626,"en":"The light upon my brow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l001","ordinal":125627,"en":"My only one, whom I lean upon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l002","ordinal":125628,"en":"My deep-rooted poplar, my plane tree,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l003","ordinal":125629,"en":"Who lifts my brow when I grieve,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l004","ordinal":125630,"en":"My dear one, on whom I rely—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l005","ordinal":125631,"en":"Has God granted you now?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l006","ordinal":125632,"en":"Wretched orphan left by Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l007","ordinal":125633,"en":"As I look, has the orphan come?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l008","ordinal":125634,"en":"Chiyirdi in her old age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l009","ordinal":125635,"en":"Kanykei now grown old—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l010","ordinal":125636,"en":"Are both your mothers well?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l011","ordinal":125637,"en":"Your kin and your land,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l012","ordinal":125638,"en":"Your maternal uncles,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l013","ordinal":125639,"en":"Your mother's father and your elder brother—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l014","ordinal":125640,"en":"Are all of you in good health?”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l015","ordinal":125641,"en":"At the sight of Bölökbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l016","ordinal":125642,"en":"Your orphan, the son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l017","ordinal":125643,"en":"Was choked with fierce anger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l018","ordinal":125644,"en":"His heart was filled with grief."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l019","ordinal":125645,"en":"The boy called an orphan—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l020","ordinal":125646,"en":"Into those dear eyes, like a saker falcon's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l021","ordinal":125647,"en":"Tears came, though he did not blink."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l022","ordinal":125648,"en":"Musterer of the host that routed the Kaldai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l023","ordinal":125649,"en":"Your orphan, son of your Khan Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l024","ordinal":125650,"en":"When he saw Bölökbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l025","ordinal":125651,"en":"Grew tearful and sobbed low."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l026","ordinal":125652,"en":"Your boy, the son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l027","ordinal":125653,"en":"Had entered Talas and found his land,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l028","ordinal":125654,"en":"The plain that had fallen to ruin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l029","ordinal":125655,"en":"And found the people left by Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l030","ordinal":125656,"en":"Your dear boy stood there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l031","ordinal":125657,"en":"Then Bölökbai wept:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l032","ordinal":125658,"en":"“Ah, God has granted it now!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l033","ordinal":125659,"en":"My mirror, my orphan, has come!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l034","ordinal":125660,"en":"Here Semetey had found him;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l035","ordinal":125661,"en":"Here Bölökbai spoke at length:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l036","ordinal":125662,"en":"“Oh, my mirror, my orphan, Khan Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l037","ordinal":125663,"en":"I have something to tell you."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l038","ordinal":125664,"en":"When leopard Manas died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0636:b004:l039","ordinal":125665,"en":"There was sorrow I endured,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l001","ordinal":125666,"en":"There is a pit dug for me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l002","ordinal":125667,"en":"There is misery boiling over me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l003","ordinal":125668,"en":"There is my waist, which I girded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l004","ordinal":125669,"en":"There is a place where I hid."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l005","ordinal":125670,"en":"Semetey, Bakai, you two lions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l006","ordinal":125671,"en":"I have something to tell you."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l007","ordinal":125672,"en":"When my companion Manas died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l008","ordinal":125673,"en":"The treasury so richly gathered—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l009","ordinal":125674,"en":"When all those dogs divided it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l010","ordinal":125675,"en":"They broke up pinewood into troughs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l011","ordinal":125676,"en":"So many slaves gathered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l012","ordinal":125677,"en":"Saying, ‘Give me my treasury now!’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l013","ordinal":125678,"en":"Alas, they laid their claims upon me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l014","ordinal":125679,"en":"There in the treasury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l015","ordinal":125680,"en":"They drained much of my strength."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l016","ordinal":125681,"en":"They drew their bows like rain;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l017","ordinal":125682,"en":"While I was unprepared,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l018","ordinal":125683,"en":"They fired shots like hail,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l019","ordinal":125684,"en":"And made me suffer greatly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l020","ordinal":125685,"en":"Abyke, Köbösh—the six villains:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l021","ordinal":125686,"en":"Through them I came to this state."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l022","ordinal":125687,"en":"Khan Manas's forty companions—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l023","ordinal":125688,"en":"Oh, my child, I saw terrible wickedness."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l024","ordinal":125689,"en":"They made me suffer living hell."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l025","ordinal":125690,"en":"His bold men took their swords."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l026","ordinal":125691,"en":"Loading them onto Abeke the slave,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l027","ordinal":125692,"en":"With the forty guards, I crossed the ridge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l028","ordinal":125693,"en":"To Kayipchi's dark cave,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l029","ordinal":125694,"en":"My colt, I fled and kept alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l030","ordinal":125695,"en":"Manas Khan's forty companions—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0637:b003:l031","ordinal":125696,"en":"Forty dog-swine from forty different places!"}]
